{"seq":3,"slug":"component-testing","title":"组件视觉与行为测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/patterns/component-testing","wordCount":911,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"组件视觉与行为测试\">组件视觉与行为测试</h1><p>设计系统的组件一旦发布，任何无意的视觉变化或行为退化都会波及所有消费方。传统单元测试只能验证逻辑正确性，无法捕捉&quot;按钮圆角从 6px 变成了 8px&quot;这类视觉回归。2026 年的设计系统测试体系需要覆盖三个维度：视觉保真、交互行为、无障碍合规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>设计系统测试的独特挑战在于：组件的&quot;正确性&quot;不仅是逻辑上的，更是视觉上和交互上的。一个 Button 即使通过了所有单元测试，如果它在某个浏览器上的 hover 状态颜色错误，对用户来说就是一个 bug。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph DS_TEST_PYRAMID[测试金字塔]&#10;        UT[单元测试]&#10;        VRT[视觉回归测试]&#10;        INT[交互测试]&#10;        A11Y[无障碍测试]&#10;        E2E[端到端测试]&#10;    end&#10;    UT --&gt; VRT&#10;    VRT --&gt; INT&#10;    INT --&gt; A11Y&#10;    A11Y --&gt; E2E\">graph TD\n    subgraph DS_TEST_PYRAMID[测试金字塔]\n        UT[单元测试]\n        VRT[视觉回归测试]\n        INT[交互测试]\n        A11Y[无障碍测试]\n        E2E[端到端测试]\n    end\n    UT --&gt; VRT\n    VRT --&gt; INT\n    INT --&gt; A11Y\n    A11Y --&gt; E2E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试类型</th>\n<th>验证维度</th>\n<th>工具链</th>\n<th>执行速度</th>\n<th>维护成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>Props → 渲染结果</td>\n<td>Vitest + Testing Library</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视觉回归</td>\n<td>像素级一致性</td>\n<td>Chromatic / Percy / Playwright</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互测试</td>\n<td>用户行为序列</td>\n<td>Storybook play / Playwright</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无障碍测试</td>\n<td>WCAG 规则覆盖</td>\n<td>axe-core / Storybook addon</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端</td>\n<td>真实业务流程</td>\n<td>Playwright / Cypress</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"视觉回归测试-visual-regression-testing\">视觉回归测试（Visual Regression Testing）</h2><p>VRT 的核心原理是&quot;截图对比&quot;：为每个 Story 生成基准截图（baseline），后续每次变更时重新截图并逐像素对比差异。</p>\n<p><strong>Chromatic 集成方案</strong>（Storybook 官方推荐）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/chromatic.yml&#10;name: Chromatic&#10;on: pull_request&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  chromatic:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install&#10;      - uses: chromaui/action@latest&#10;        with:&#10;          projectToken: ${{ secrets.CHROMATIC_TOKEN }}&#10;          buildScriptName: build-storybook\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/chromatic.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Chromatic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  chromatic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">chromaui/action@latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          projectToken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.CHROMATIC_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          buildScriptName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">build-storybook</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Chromatic 在检测到视觉变化时会生成差异报告，由设计师或系统维护者审批&quot;接受&quot;或&quot;拒绝&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变化类型</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有意的样式更新</td>\n<td>审批 Accept，更新 baseline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无意的视觉退化</td>\n<td>拒绝，修复后重新提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反锯齿/渲染微差</td>\n<td>设置容差阈值忽略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Playwright 自建方案</strong>（不依赖 SaaS）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { test, expect } from &#39;@playwright/test&#39;;&#10;&#10;test(&#39;Button variants visual consistency&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;  await page.goto(&#39;/iframe.html?id=components-button--all-sizes&#39;);&#10;&#10;  await expect(page.locator(&#39;.sb-main-padded&#39;)).toHaveScreenshot(&#39;button-all-sizes.png&#39;, { maxDiffPixelRatio: 0.01 });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { test, expect } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@playwright/test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Button variants visual consistency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">goto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/iframe.html?id=components-button--all-sizes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">locator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.sb-main-padded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toHaveScreenshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'button-all-sizes.png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { maxDiffPixelRatio: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"交互测试-模拟真实用户行为\">交互测试：模拟真实用户行为</h2><p>交互测试验证组件在用户操作序列下的行为正确性。Storybook 的 play function 和 Playwright 的组件测试是两种主流方案。</p>\n<p><strong>Storybook Play Function</strong>（适合组件级）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { expect, userEvent, within, fn } from &#39;@storybook/test&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const DialogInteraction: Story = {&#10;  args: { onConfirm: fn() },&#10;  play: async ({ canvasElement, args }) =&gt; {&#10;    const canvas = within(canvasElement);&#10;&#10;    // 点击触发器打开 Dialog&#10;    await userEvent.click(canvas.getByRole(&#39;button&#39;, { name: &#39;删除&#39; }));&#10;&#10;    // 验证 Dialog 出现&#10;    const dialog = within(document.body).getByRole(&#39;alertdialog&#39;);&#10;    await expect(dialog).toBeVisible();&#10;&#10;    // 验证焦点移动到 Dialog 内&#10;    await expect(dialog).toContainElement(document.activeElement);&#10;&#10;    // 点击确认&#10;    await userEvent.click(within(dialog).getByRole(&#39;button&#39;, { name: &#39;确认删除&#39; }));&#10;&#10;    // 验证回调被调用&#10;    await expect(args.onConfirm).toHaveBeenCalledOnce();&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { expect, userEvent, within, fn } from '@storybook/test';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const DialogInteraction: Story = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  args: { onConfirm: fn() },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  play: async ({ canvasElement, args }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const canvas = within(canvasElement);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 点击触发器打开 Dialog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await userEvent.click(canvas.getByRole('button', { name: '删除' }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 验证 Dialog 出现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const dialog = within(document.body).getByRole('alertdialog');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await expect(dialog).toBeVisible();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 验证焦点移动到 Dialog 内</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await expect(dialog).toContainElement(document.activeElement);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 点击确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await userEvent.click(within(dialog).getByRole('button', { name: '确认删除' }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 验证回调被调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await expect(args.onConfirm).toHaveBeenCalledOnce();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Playwright Component Testing</strong>（适合跨浏览器）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { test, expect } from &#39;@playwright/experimental-ct-react&#39;;&#10;import { Accordion } from &#39;./Accordion&#39;;&#10;&#10;test(&#39;Accordion keyboard navigation&#39;, async ({ mount }) =&gt; {&#10;  const component = await mount(&#10;    &lt;Accordion type=&quot;single&quot; collapsible&gt;&#10;      &lt;Accordion.Item value=&quot;item-1&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;Accordion.Trigger&gt;第一项&lt;/Accordion.Trigger&gt;&#10;        &lt;Accordion.Content&gt;内容一&lt;/Accordion.Content&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Accordion.Item&gt;&#10;      &lt;Accordion.Item value=&quot;item-2&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;Accordion.Trigger&gt;第二项&lt;/Accordion.Trigger&gt;&#10;        &lt;Accordion.Content&gt;内容二&lt;/Accordion.Content&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Accordion.Item&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Accordion&gt;&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  // Tab 到第一个 trigger&#10;  await component.getByRole(&#39;button&#39;, { name: &#39;第一项&#39; }).focus();&#10;&#10;  // Enter 展开&#10;  await component.press(&#39;Enter&#39;);&#10;  await expect(component.getByText(&#39;内容一&#39;)).toBeVisible();&#10;&#10;  // ArrowDown 到下一个&#1